  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://blay09.net/files/brand/kleeslabs.png\" alt=\"KleeSlabs\" width=\"836\" height=\"200\"></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/requires-balm.png\" alt=\"需要Balm支持\" width=\"260\" height=\"80\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmods.twelveiterations.com%252fsponsor\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"margin-left:26px\" src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/new-patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon赞助支持\" width=\"550\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p>本模组允许你仅破坏双半砖的其中一半。被破坏的部分取决于你当前视线聚焦的那一侧。</p>\n<p>支持原版半砖及众多模组添加的半砖。若发现不兼容的模组半砖，请在问题追踪器提交报告。</p>\n<p>本模组支持NeoForge、Fabric和Forge平台，需搭配<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balm</a>前置模组使用。</p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/features-header.png\" alt=\"功能特色\" width=\"836\" height=\"40\"></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>精准破坏你视线所指的双半砖特定半侧</li>\n<li>全面兼容所有原版半砖</li>\n<li>支持众多模组添加的半砖类型</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/63/864/kleeslabs194.gif\" alt=\"演示动画\" width=\"847\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/credits-header.png\" alt=\"创作鸣谢\" width=\"836\" height=\"40\"></h3>\n<p>本模组灵感源自<a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/kleetho\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kleetho</a>主播在其订阅马拉松活动中的建议，故以\"Klee\"命名。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
